From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devarsh Thakkar <devarsht@ti.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Dec 2025 03:27:51 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] PENDING: drm/tiny: add SSD16xx e-paper display support

Add a DRM driver for Solomon Systech SSD16xx e-paper controllers and
support the Good Display GDEY042T81 400x300 panel with an SSD1683
controller.

Forward-port the driver integration to the DRM client setup API used by
TI Linux 6.18.

Propagate panel-ready failures, reject framebuffers without a CPU mapping,
and periodically perform a full refresh to limit e-paper ghosting.

The original driver was developed by Devarsh Thakkar at Texas
Instruments. The 6.18 backport was developed with assistance from
OpenAI Codex.

Link: https://github.com/TexasInstruments/ti-linux-kernel/commit/7845a75c5c754570830696603142090002afbe14

Signed-off-by: Devarsh Thakkar <devarsht@ti.com>
Signed-off-by: Andrei Aldea <andrei1998@gmail.com>
